  suite_cli_heap.adam - --heap in a release adam (the one a release ships
  and the one these rows run): a release build tracks no heap, so it has no
  report to print and neither shows nor takes --heap (only a debug adam,
  such as build-adam's stage A, has it): CL0005, exit 2, nothing checked
*******************************************************************************/

/*
@@test
  kind cli
  args "--no-banner" "--heap" "check" "<DIR>/suite_cli_heap.adam"
  exitcode 2
  | Error CL0005: '--heap' is not an option of 'check'; see 'adam help check'
@@end
*/

